        "TileImage": "$($repository bf60280b-9b3b-4837-a90e-8cbcfe46d515).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47,\r\rYour target is Maxwell Rutter. As a Kronstadt&apos;s Industry promoter and close friend to it&apos;s CEO, Mr. Rutter is Kronstadt&apos;s most valuable asset while supporting it&apos;s CEO, media and public opinion. Our clients are business rivals of Kronstadt Industry and they need to strike them in a way where Kronstadt will fall down on it&apos;s failure. Without harming CEO, you will need to eliminate Rutter&apos;s Supporting Syndicate to ensure, he won&apos;t be replaced by his people.\r\rGood luck agent.",
